Z||000005||mrfiero||10-20-2001||08:42 PM||||An auto. does not have a throw out bearing!<P>BTW.....to relace one, if you did have one, would require dropping the tranny so big $$$.<P><BR>The arcing sound is likely a bad coil wire or bad plug wires.  The spark from the coil is escaping the wiring and arcing across to the engine or ??  Try replacing the coil wire and see what happens.  <P>||||reg||1
